      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>&lt;must_gather_local_dir&gt;</code></dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>Replace with the actual directory name.</p></dd>
      </dl>
      </li>
      <li>Attach the compressed file to your support case on the <a href="https://access.redhat.com/support/cases/#/case/list">the <strong>Customer Support</strong> page</a> of the Red Hat Customer Portal.</li>
      </ol>
      <section class="related-resources _additional-resources">
      <p class="related-resources-title">Additional resources</p>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/nodes/cma/nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom#nodes-cma-autoscaling-custom-gather">Gathering debugging data for the Custom Metrics Autoscaler</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://access.redhat.com/support/policy/updates/openshift">Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform Life Cycle Policy</a></li>
      </ul>
